1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,480
If you mow the lawn a lot, you know the seat on your mower isn't great.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,000
Mine is cracked and uncomfortable.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Your backside gets soaked after rain, and it hurts if you ride more than twenty minutes.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,760
But this seat cover fixes those problems, and you get built-in cooler pockets for your beer and tool pockets at the back of the seat.

5
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,280
For me it was a no-brainer, but now I regret it.

6
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:35,880
Right now they have a sale on these, and the price is lower than when I bought mine. But hurry before it ends.
